.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH dfdu-agent 1  "dfdu-agent " 
.SH NAME
dfdu\-agent \- Scan for a dfdu on another host (`\-\-remote`): reads requests on stdin and writes what it finds to stdout in dfdu\*(Aqs wire format. Not for use by hand
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdfdu agent\fR [\fB\-\-threads\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scan for a dfdu on another host (`\-\-remote`): reads requests on stdin and writes what it finds to stdout in dfdu\*(Aqs wire format. Not for use by hand
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<THREADS>\fR
Worker threads
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
